      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "As shown by a 6-month follow-up of anginal patients exposed to a single 10-day course of infrared laser radiation, the antianginal effect of this laser treatment manifested 1 month after the end of the radiation, was registered in 80-82% of the patients and persisted after 6-month follow-up in 62.5% of the patients. The therapeutic effect was the highest in patients with severe coronary insufficiency."},
